From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:32:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] AROS: the develop pipeline runs on the CPU, without wgpu

wgpu has no AROS backend (no Vulkan, Metal or DX12 driver there). The GPU crate compiles to its CPU fallback on target_os = "aros", as it does for the web build: the cfg gates that leave wgpu out on wasm32 leave it out on AROS too. The CPU pipeline is LightCraft's reference implementation; the GPU setting has no effect on AROS.
---
 crates/engine/src/cmd/face_detect.rs    |   7 +-
 crates/engine/src/cmd/face_recognize.rs |   7 +-
 crates/engine/src/media/render.rs       |  10 +-
 crates/gpu/Cargo.toml                   |   2 +-
 crates/gpu/src/lib.rs                   | 120 ++++++++++++------------
 crates/gpu/src/vram.rs                  |   8 +-
 6 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

